{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grenmark is <i>not</i> a kind place, and it does not care who you are when you arrive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pale Coins is an old school <strong>Fantasy Action RPG</strong> with soulslike elements, built around challenging gameplay and well earned victories. Explore the lands, descend into punishing dungeons, and face boss fights with great creatures that test skill and resolve. Claim your loot, take on perilous quests, and uncover the lore of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/8ab4a9a86c384676b996617594d99db2.webp?t=1767975563\" width=620 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/7d4999fcbf3ab7fca44a431542af3a89.poster.avif?t=1767975563\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/7d4999fcbf3ab7fca44a431542af3a89.webm?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/7d4999fcbf3ab7fca44a431542af3a89.mp4?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for battle as you venture beyond the safety of the capital and its villages, where many monsters wait in the wilds. Among them are formidable boss encounters that will test your wisdom and skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/53088f24ba13ebdab6517b593a74e2be.webp?t=1767975563\" width=620 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/b109e539b71ca351ff0fc04a2f168047.poster.avif?t=1767975563\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/b109e539b71ca351ff0fc04a2f168047.webm?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/b109e539b71ca351ff0fc04a2f168047.mp4?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unearth a wide arsenal of melee, ranged, and magic weapons, each with its own stats and skills, alongside a deep selection of armor sets that let you shape your character into something entirely your own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/399273ec1a9e6504787b58b67ce2c681.webp?t=1767975563\" width=620 height=32 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/09816a75e73423848ae86f937c5160a0.poster.avif?t=1767975563\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/09816a75e73423848ae86f937c5160a0.webm?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/09816a75e73423848ae86f937c5160a0.mp4?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare equipment scattered throughout the vibrant world of Grenmark that grants powerful skills while worn. Cast special magic spells, gain new movement abilities, summon minions, and unlock far more as you experiment with different items. Seek them out, learn what they can do, and master the skills that fit your style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/f47b356e610322f3cc52b15f17641d9d.webp?t=1767975563\" width=620 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/559cd1dd884d50956cdb9f62587e11b2.poster.avif?t=1767975563\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/559cd1dd884d50956cdb9f62587e11b2.webm?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/559cd1dd884d50956cdb9f62587e11b2.mp4?t=1767975563\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Explore a handcrafted fantasy world that does not offer comfort or certainty. Begin with nothing but an old weapon and the road ahead. Cross forests and  ruins, climb inside volcanos, and descend into caverns where light struggles to follow. Along the way, meet strangers and learn their stories as you search for the long lost Champion\u2019s Coin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438330/extras/2c1fcc44df2d11640ee6bde546160711.webp?t=1767975563\" width=620 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Gorgeous handcrafted pixel-art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Expansive world to explore, filled with NPCs and dungeons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Challenging combat and unique skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A variety of unique and difficult bosses to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Tons of equipment and items to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Many branching storylines and quests to complete</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Old-school RPG with no handholding</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/41338c6360adb1c7abfa3627e6041d559c012ff8.jpg"},{"name":"Save the Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/f7c3f9025af5149f32ca2993cbddd55825533faa.jpg"},{"name":"Level 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/58139dec96d25660513c1af92f010a4a44f272e9.jpg"},{"name":"Blacksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/ddc4f39ff1d461e7ba67cbbca4964d5445d5d164.jpg"},{"name":"Stone of Water","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/8a057fd0835f067ebca766dcbb98ef06c6e6ce80.jpg"},{"name":"Stone of Fire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/bacc3a2b974f27fe7030c7060d1cae319b26ab83.jpg"},{"name":"Stone of Earth","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/e158ab8c23452b218e8a5829ba86a596531b64d5.jpg"},{"name":"The Eternal Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/543726cdfc2f4b97d16132d4bf6ec820d04cf482.jpg"},{"name":"The Keeper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/6cbad67bd69d23361fd75574f9a870854cf649da.jpg"},{"name":"The Bandits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2438330/5755743196f38e367957baed0a6e9a6bcf7421f0.jpg"}],"total":27},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2438330?t=176797556